    "description": "The Guard may make a reroll on <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception</a> checks to wear disguises. She must take the second roll, even if it's worse. The Guard is considered trained in <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception</a> for this check.<br><br>You may reroll any <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception</a> check to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deceive\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Deceive\">Deceive</a>, but the result of the reroll must be accepted, even if it is worse. You are considered <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Trained\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trained\">Trained</a> in the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception</a> skill for the purposes of these checks.",
